{"checkedAt":"2026-09-11T11:53:29.990Z","sourceUrl":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/2931","imdbCode":"tt4494948","seriesTitle":"Shimmer and Shine","imdbRating":5.2,"imdbVotes":888,"episodes":[{"season":1,"episode":1,"title":"The Sweetest Thing","summary":"When Leah wishes for help making cupcakes for her school bake sale, she and the genies find themselves stuck with a giant birthday cake, some farm animals, and a river of cupcake batter. How in the world will Leah finish her cupcakes without any wishes left, or worse, explain all this craziness to her curious (and hungry) neighbor Zac?","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/332/831426.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":2,"title":"Genie Treehouse","summary":"Leah and Zac try building a treehouse but find themselves in over their heads. Leah asks her genies for a treehouse and is thrown for a loop when Shimmer and Shine turn her house into a house of trees!","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/332/831427.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":3,"title":"Lights! Camera! Genies!","summary":"Leah asks Shimmer and Shine for some movie magic help, but they accidentally wish the movie to life, turning Leah into a medieval princess.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/332/831428.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":4,"title":"What a Pig Mess","summary":"When Leah asks her genies for more pigs in a blanket, they give her real pigs wrapped in blankets rather than the party food.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/332/831429.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":5,"title":"Abraca-Genie","summary":"When Zac struggles with the magic tricks in his act, Leah calls on her genies for some real magic assistance.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/332/831430.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Ahoy, Genies!","summary":"When Leah's bucket full of beach treasures floats into the vast ocean, Leah summons Shimmer and Shine to help her retrieve the loot. With the genies' assistance, a typical day at the beach quickly escalates into a magical beach treasure hunt, complete with a treasure map, pirate ship, and a talking parrot!","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/332/831431.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":7,"title":"Dino Might!","summary":"After searching everywhere for Zac's lost dinosaur toy, Leah asks her genies to wish up a replacement.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/332/831432.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":8,"title":"A Very Genie Halloweenie","summary":"It's Halloween and Leah invites her genies over to join the fun (since everyone is in costume, no one will know they're real genies!). To celebrate, Zac is competing in a haunted house competition, but he accidentally ruins his own decorations. Leah makes a wish to make his house look haunted and the genies turn it into a real haunted house, complete with a real live Frankenstein! It's a spooktacular adventure as the girls try to stop Frankenstein from smashing every Jack-O'-Lantern in Leah's neighborhood.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/332/831433.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":9,"title":"Backyard Ballet","summary":"While Leah and Zac are trying to re-enact their new favorite ballet, Leah makes a wish to be a ballerina like the Swan Queen.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/332/831434.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":10,"title":"Game On","summary":"Leah and Zac save up for months to get the big prize at the arcade, but the ticket counting machine malfunctions.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/332/831435.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":11,"title":"Santa's Little Genies","summary":"A christmas special. It's Christmas Eve and Leah forgot to mail Zac's letter to Santa. When she calls on Shimmer and Shine to help deliver the letter, they transport her to the North Pole where Leah can deliver it to Santa in person. After she accidentally wishes Santa to a tropical island, it's up to Shimmer and Shine to deliver the presents and save Christmas genie-style.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/332/831436.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":12,"title":"Spaceship Wrecked","summary":"When Leah wishes that she were able to talk to an alien, Shimmer and Shine poof one into her backyard.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/332/831437.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":13,"title":"Happy Wishaversary","summary":"It's time for Shimmer, Shine, and Leah to celebrate their Wishaversary! Leah's thrilled to celebrate her friendship with her favorite genies.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/332/831438.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":14,"title":"Sleep-Over Party","summary":"Leah invites Shimmer and Shine to a sleepover party where they will eat pizza, dance and sleep in a pillow fort.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/332/831439.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":15,"title":"Dream Dollhouse","summary":"When Leah wishes for more doll friends for her genies to play with in her new dollhouse, the genies shrink themselves and Leah down to doll size.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/332/831440.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":16,"title":"Gone Bowlin'","summary":"Leah and Zac are pumped for day of bowling! But Leah is having a tough time trying to knock down a single pin, so she calls on Shimmer and Shine to lend a little genie magic to improve her game.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/332/831441.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":17,"title":"The Great Skate Mistake","summary":"Leah and Zac are at the skate park practicing for the big skateboard competition. But right before the competition starts, Leah's skateboard breaks!","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/332/831442.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":18,"title":"Escape Goat","summary":"When Leah accidentally lets a goat out of its pen at the petting zoo, she calls on Shimmer and Shine to help get him back. The girls and pets are led on a farmland adventure in pursuit of the escaped goat.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/332/831443.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":19,"title":"The First Wish Part One","summary":"Leah wins a genie bottle pendant at a carnival and is surprised to find that her prize comes with a bonus – genies Shimmer and Shine. Leah makes a silly wish for a polka-dotted elephant.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/332/831444.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":20,"title":"The First Wish Part Two","summary":"","imageUrl":"/api/episode-art/tt44949